      "content": "# Kubernetes (Prometheus Operator): Strata behind a Service whose port is named \"http\".\n# The API key lives in a Secret (key \"key\"), sent as a bearer token.\napiVersion: monitoring.coreos.com/v1\nkind: ServiceMonitor\nmetadata:\n  name: strata\n  labels:\n    release: kube-prometheus-stack   # whatever your Prometheus selects ServiceMonitors by\nspec:\n  selector:\n    matchLabels:\n      app: strata\n  endpoints:\n    - port: http\n      path: /metrics\n      interval: 15s\n      authorization:\n        type: Bearer\n        credentials:\n          name: strata-api-key\n          key: key\n"
    },
